ld like him to be drawn handsome/pretty, but not like a child. He is 17+ years old. He is a happy and adventurous guy who likes to travel and goof around. Has little fangs that you can see when he smiles/grins. He can control water and is very athletic. \n\nI would like a fullbody of him if possible. Pose and expression are entirely up to you. If you can draw his weapon that would be nice, but you do not have to draw it. \n\nOr! \nIf you would not like to draw Mao, maybe consider one of these other boys of mine?: https://sta.sh/21qlpjkn7pqx?edit=1\nA fullbody for whoever you pick would be amazing. \nI leave the character and pose entirely up to you! \n\nThank you so much for considering! <3", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hagara810/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/213ee130/uploads/origins/346fec4e-e36d-447b-9d59-489a128de92d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=32dae05edf91f88f790b818d3a1b0c51", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/213ee130/uploads/origins/346fec4e-e36d-447b-9d59-489a128de92d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=32dae05edf91f88f790b818d3a1b0c51, https://si.imgix.net/213ee130/uploads/origins/346fec4e-e36d-447b-9d59-489a128de92d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01aaed82a19286b8f3dd2223632490d3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/213ee130/uploads/origins/346fec4e-e36d-447b-9d59-489a128de92d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2507f0b178160046c71eddefe614233 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のVTuberの絵をお願いしたいです。表情や体のポージングはお任せします。\n\n描いていただいた絵は、TwitterやTwitch、YoutubeなどのSNSで使用したいと思います。ご検討よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/speckvtuber/status/1379527039938482182", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hagara810/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2d2a312d/uploads/origins/f9048be4-7d40-4650-8227-42aa3b30df16?bg=%23fff&auto=f